OL,3,CWhat are my travel rights if I am due
OL,4,Cto go to wildfire-hit France and Spain?
OL,6,FWildfires across France and Spain have
OL,7,Fforced hundreds of thousands of people
OL,8,Fto flee advancing flames, including
OL,9,Ftourists.
OL,11,FAmong the areas affected are holiday
OL,12,Fdestinations popular with British
OL,13,Fvisitors, including the Cap Ferret
OL,14,Fpeninsula near Bordeaux.
OL,16,FLast week, a large part of the region
OL,17,Fwas evacuated, with some tourists
OL,18,Fneeding to be rescued by boat as an
OL,19,F"intense and highly unpredictable"
OL,20,Fwildfire tore through the area.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/14
