OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1785176311
OL,3,CWhat are my travel rights if I am due
OL,4,Cto go to wildfire-hit France and Spain?
OL,6,FLarge wildfires have also been burning
OL,7,Fnear the Spanish capital, Madrid,
OL,8,Fprompting the evacuation of more than
OL,9,F100,000 people.
OL,11,FWith the peak summer holiday season
OL,12,Fabout to begin, some officials are
OL,13,Furging people to avoid travelling to
OL,14,Faffected areas.
OL,16,FThe danger to many is all too real.
OL,17,FEarlier this month, several Brits were
OL,18,Famong 13 people who died in a wildfire
OL,19,Fin southern Spain.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
