OL,3,CWhat are my travel rights if I am due
OL,4,Cto go to wildfire-hit France and Spain?
OL,6,FHere's what you need to know if
OL,7,Fwildfires could put your holiday at
OL,8,Frisk.
OL,10,FIs it safe to travel to the affected
OL,11,Farea?
OL,13,FThe UK Foreign, Commonwealth &
OL,14,FDevelopment Office (FCDO) has issued
OL,15,Ftravel alerts for both France and
OL,16,FSpain due to the wildfires.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30904
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1785176311
OL,3,CWhat are my travel rights if I am due
OL,4,Cto go to wildfire-hit France and Spain?
OL,6,FFor Spain, the FCDO has highlighted
OL,7,Fthe wildfires around Madrid and Avila,
OL,8,Furging any Britons in the area to
OL,9,Ffollow local authorities' advice. The
OL,10,FMadrid local government is also
OL,11,Fadvising against travel to the
OL,12,Faffected areas.
OL,14,FThe FCDO also has a warning out for
OL,15,Fthe wildfires in Gironde and a general
OL,16,Fwarning for the whole country. It has
OL,17,Furged anyone who is planning a holiday
OL,18,Fin the region to check with their
OL,19,Fholiday provider before travelling.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30905
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1785176311
OL,3,CWhat are my travel rights if I am due
OL,4,Cto go to wildfire-hit France and Spain?
OL,6,FThey also said: "French authorities
OL,7,Fhave evacuated campsites, tourist
OL,8,Faccommodation and some residential
OL,9,Fareas.
OL,11,F"Access to affected areas may be
OL,12,Frestricted and roads may close at
OL,13,Fshort notice. Further evacuations may
OL,14,Ftake place."
OL,16,FSophie Brocas, the prefect of the
OL,17,FGironde department, said: "I urge
OL,18,Ftourists not to come."
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
