CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1785176311
OL,3,CWhat are my travel rights if I am due
OL,4,Cto go to wildfire-hit France and Spain?
OL,6,FGironde authorities have banned
OL,7,Fholiday camps for children and for
OL,8,Fpeople with disabilities.
OL,10,FAnita Mendiratta, special advisor to
OL,11,Fthe United Nations on tourism and
OL,12,Faviation, told ITV News: "What is
OL,13,Freally important is staying very close
OL,14,Fto the government offices, and also
OL,15,Fwhere you are going to be staying and
OL,16,Fwith whom you're going to be flying
OL,17,Fwith because if you cancel
OL,18,Fvoluntarily, the chance of you getting
OL,19,Fzero refund is very high.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30907
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1785176311
OL,3,CWhat are my travel rights if I am due
OL,4,Cto go to wildfire-hit France and Spain?
OL,6,F"If, however, the airlines or the
OL,7,Faccommodation require that you need to
OL,8,Fcancel, then there is an opportunity."
OL,10,FBut she added: "Most importantly, put
OL,11,Fsafety before compensation."
OL,13,FHow can travellers check the latest
OL,14,Fwildfire situation?
OL,16,FThe French government has a website
OL,17,Fthat tracks active wildfires in France
OL,18,Fat www.feuxdeforet.fr.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/14
