OL,3,CWhat are my travel rights if I am due
OL,4,Cto go to wildfire-hit France and Spain?
OL,6,FSpain does not have a similar website,
OL,7,Fbut globally, wildfires can be tracked
OL,8,Fon CurrentWildfires, which has a
OL,9,Fspecific page tracking blazes in Spain
OL,10,Fat www.currentwildfires.com/en/
OL,11,Fwildfires-spain.
OL,13,FThe FCDO also regularly updates its
OL,14,Ftravel advice regarding the wildfires.
OL,16,FWhat are your rights if your flight or
OL,17,Fferry is cancelled due to wildfires?
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
