OL,3,CWhat are my travel rights if I am due
OL,4,Cto go to wildfire-hit France and Spain?
OL,6,FUnder UK law, those affected by flight
OL,7,Fdelays or cancellations have legal
OL,8,Frights which oblige airlines to
OL,9,Fprovide support to customers flying
OL,10,Ffrom a UK airport, arriving in the
OL,11,Fcountry on a European Union (EU) or UK
OL,12,Fairline, or arriving at an EU airport
OL,13,Fon a UK airline.
OL,15,FIf your flight is covered under UK
OL,16,Flaw, your airline must give you the
OL,17,Foption of choosing another flight or
OL,18,Fproviding a full refund. You can get
OL,19,Fmoney back on any part of the ticket
OL,20,Fnot used.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
