OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1785176311
OL,3,CWhat are my travel rights if I am due
OL,4,Cto go to wildfire-hit France and Spain?
OL,6,FAirlines are required to pay
OL,7,Fcompensation if flights arrive more
OL,8,Fthan three hours late, but only when
OL,9,Fit is deemed to be within their
OL,10,Fcontrol.
OL,12,FHowever, wildfires are generally
OL,13,Ftreated as an "extraordinary
OL,14,Fcircumstance" or natural disaster, in
OL,15,Fterms of legislation and are therefore
OL,16,Fnot considered within an airline's
OL,17,Fcontrol, so don't expect compensation.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G10/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
