OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1785176311
OL,3,CWhat are my travel rights if I am due
OL,4,Cto go to wildfire-hit France and Spain?
OL,6,FDespite the fires taking place near
OL,7,Fseveral major airports as of Monday,
OL,8,Fno flights have been cancelled as a
OL,9,Fresult of the recent wildfires in
OL,10,FSpain and France.
OL,12,FFor ferries, the rules are slightly
OL,13,Fdifferent, but the same concepts apply
OL,14,Fto delays or cancellations, with the
OL,15,Foperator obliged to offer you an
OL,16,Falternative route or refund.
OL,18,FCan you cancel a package holiday if
OL,19,Fwildfires threaten your destination?
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G11/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
