OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1785176311
OL,3,CWhat are my travel rights if I am due
OL,4,Cto go to wildfire-hit France and Spain?
OL,6,FThe Package Travel and Linked Travel
OL,7,FArrangements Regulations say you
OL,8,Fshould be given a full refund on a
OL,9,Fholiday if there are "unavoidable and
OL,10,Fextraordinary circumstances".
OL,12,FThe fires will need to be a direct
OL,13,Fthreat to your accommodation to
OL,14,Ftrigger the regulations; fires being
OL,15,Fvaguely nearby will not be sufficient.
OL,17,FIf the FCDO ever issues advice
OL,18,Fadvising against travel to the region,
OL,19,Fthat will usually be enough to qualify
OL,20,Ffor a full refund.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G12/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
