FL,310,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30913
SC,0013
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1785176311
OL,3,CWhat are my travel rights if I am due
OL,4,Cto go to wildfire-hit France and Spain?
OL,6,FWhat if you've booked flights and
OL,7,Faccommodation separately?
OL,9,FThis will be trickier, because the
OL,10,Fhotel may still be open and operating,
OL,11,Feven if your flights are cancelled.
OL,13,FThe rules for flights will still
OL,14,Fapply, and you will be able to claim
OL,15,Fback the cost of the tickets.
OL,17,FBut if you decide to get a refund and
OL,18,Fnot seek alternative travel because of
OL,19,Fthe danger, this does not mean you're
OL,20,Fguaranteed a refund from your
OL,21,Faccommodation.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G13/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
