FL,310,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30914
SC,0014
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1785176311
OL,3,CWhat are my travel rights if I am due
OL,4,Cto go to wildfire-hit France and Spain?
OL,6,FA hotel may stay open despite the
OL,7,Fwildfires and say that it is safe
OL,8,Fwhere they are, and if so, they're not
OL,9,Fobliged to refund you if you've
OL,10,Fpersonally decided it is not safe.
OL,12,FTravel insurance may be able to help,
OL,13,Fbut you must ensure your travel
OL,14,Finsurance policy covers natural
OL,15,Fdisasters or specifically wildfires.
OL,17,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,18,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,19,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,20,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G14/14
